🎯 Objective and Scope

The project focused on helping a high-end SME—serving royal clients like HRH the King and HSH Prince Albert II of Monaco—mitigate digitalisation risks to product quality and availability. You quantified these risks using Bayesian fault-tree analysis, Monte Carlo simulation, and FMEA-to-probability mapping. All controls and architecture proposals were tested against sub-minute RTO (Recovery Time Objective) and RPO (Recovery Point Objective) targets

