🔢 Quantitative Risk Modelling

You applied three advanced techniques:

Bayesian Fault Tree Analysis (BFTA):
Used to assess the weekly risk of fulfilment SLA breach due to IT, OT, cloud, or payment failures.
🔍 Outcome: ~10.7% annual risk (post-control) of major order delays

