🛠️ Disaster Recovery / Business Continuity (DR/BC) Architecture

You designed and tested a sub-minute DR/BC solution:

Multi-region active-active deployment

Traffic manager + CDN + TLS termination

Synchronous OLTP replication

Mirrored message queues for idempotent processing

Live failover tested to RTO ≤ 60s, RPO ≤ 60s
