🔍 KPIs and Metrics

To ensure continuous validation of the controls, you proposed measurable KPIs:

Quality: Defect escape rate, AI false negatives, human-sampled lots

Availability: Weekly stockout rate, SLA fulfilment, failover times

Security: MTTD/MTTR, phishing test results, access recertification time

Portability: % infra as code, exit testing, data export verification

